<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT-Pentex hit by slowdown.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pentex hit by slowdown.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Investment Research downgraded Pentex-Schweizer Circuits Ltd, a printed circuit board (PCB) maker, on Thursday after earnings fell below expectations.</p>
<p>DBS advised investors to switch to Elec &amp; Eltek International Co since Pentex did not see any significant improvement in market conditions.  </p>
<p>On Wednesday, Pentex reported a 2.2 percent drop in net profit to Singapore $11.56 million against S$11.82 previously.</p>
<p>Elec &amp; Eltek is another PCB maker, controlled by Elec &amp; Eltek International Holdings.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
